   "message": "SEB-436: pages out of git, the box restarts collection, one alarm per outage (#779)\n\nGenerated pages are built on the runner and deployed, the chain starts its successor before it collects, the box restarts a dead chain, and the audit watchdog leaves collection gaps to the collector watchdog. See the PR for the detail."
