   "message": "SEB-301: Retest the p2p_spread_signal finding for the first time (backlog 19a) (#774)\n\n* SEB-301: retest the p2p_spread_signal finding for the first time (backlog 19a)\n\nAdds findings_tests/p2p_spread_signal.json (same keys as price_changes.json)\nand tests/agent_spread_signal_test.py, which runs the calculation on 40\nmade-up rows. 6a gets its real block reason: item 6 was cut on 25 Oct.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* SEB-301: tick backlog 19a (PR #774)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Sebastian Roervig <sebastian.roervig@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>"
