   "message": "SEB-425: steady menu, no jump on page change (#771)\n\n* Steady menu: order and grouping in CSS by address, one order in every script, links in the HTML on Home and How it works, same header gaps on every page\n\nThe menu was drawn in the old order by each page's script and regrouped a moment later, so it jumped on every page change.\nTwo header styles also put it 4 to 8px apart.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KxKUVJ7NJdnzA3156o2Bpz\n\n* Leave the baked country pages to the hourly run\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KxKUVJ7NJdnzA3156o2Bpz\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>"
